---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import balloons from '../../data/balloons.json';
---

<Layout
  title="Temecula Hot Air Balloon Rides"
  description="Compare Temecula Valley hot air balloon operators for sunrise vineyard flights — packages, what to expect, and trip-planning tips."
>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif tracking-tight mb-4">Hot Air Balloon Rides</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-stone-600 max-w-3xl mb-12">
      Sunrise flights over Temecula vineyards are one of the valley’s signature experiences. Operators below are listed
      for trip planning — confirm weather holds, pricing, and pickup details on each company’s official site before you book.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      {balloons.map((b) => (
        <a href={`/balloons/${b.slug}`} class="group block rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 bg-white hover:shadow-xl transition">
          <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden">
            <img src={b.image} alt={b.name} class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl group-hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition">{b.name}</h2>
            <p class="text-stone-600 mt-2">{b.tagline}</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mt-3 line-clamp-3">{b.summary}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-3xl p-8 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">Planning tips</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Flights are weather-dependent; keep a flexible morning if your trip is short.</li>
        <li>Expect very early check-in for sunrise launches.</li>
        <li>If you taste wine the same day, fly first — then designate a driver for afternoon tastings.</li>
        <li>We are an independent directory, not a ticket reseller.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
